api_surface:
(sketch)
POST /v1/dedicated/tenants/:id/burst-requests
  body: {duration_seconds, max_concurrency, model_variant, max_cost_usd}
  returns: {granted_seconds, token_id, billing_meta}
GET /v1/dedicated/tenants/:id/headroom
  returns: {current_band_pct, expected_replenish_time, recent_adjustments}
PATCH /v1/dedicated/tenants/:id/autoscale-config
  body: {min_headroom_pct, max_headroom_pct, aggressiveness, eviction_priority}
Notes: tokens expire and are revocable by guardbook actions. Billing metadata links to usage ledger. UI will allow one-click revoke for PM/SRE.
